{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Code Geass: Akito the Exiled - The Wyvern Arrives","It is the year 2017, and Europe is being invaded by the forces of the Holy Britannian Empire. In an attempt to combat the opposition's overwhelming pressure and put an end to the massive casualties, the army forms a special unit called Wyvern, or W-0, composed of former Japanese citizens referred to as \"Elevens.\" Recruited from ghettos, these young men and women pilot Knightmare frames—humanoid war machines—into dangerous operations where death awaits, hoping to make a name for themselves.\n\n\n\nWhen a European regiment attempting to recapture a crucial city is pinned down by the enemy, it's up to W-0 to bail them out. Among those selected for the rescue operation is Lieutenant Akito Hyuuga, known as \"Hannibal's Ghost\" due to his prowess on the battlefield. However, the supposed rescue mission becomes suicidal when, in an attempt to take out as many Britannians as possible, the commanding officer initiates the Knightmare's self-destruct sequence. In its aftermath, Akito finds that he is the last one standing…\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite) \n\n\nNote: The film received a special pre-screening on July 16, 2012 at theatres in Shinjuku Ward 9 and Ikebukuro Cinema Sunshine."],"ja":["コードギアス 亡国のアキト 第1章 翼竜は舞い降りた",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":15197,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-8888","ids":{"shikimori":8888,"mal":8888,"anilist":8888,"kodik":"serial-22106"},"kodikIds":["serial-6253","serial-17259","serial-22106"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-6253":"2019-12-02T13:33:16Z","serial-17259":"2019-12-11T02:11:20Z","serial-22106":"2020-01-31T17:01:56Z"},"title":"Код Гиас: Отступник Акито 1 — Падение Виверны","originalTitle":"Code Geass: Boukoku no Akito","alt":"Код Гиас: Отступник Акито / Code Geass: Akito the Exiled Code Geass: Akito the Exiled - The Wyvern Arrives コードギアス 亡国のアキト 第1章 翼竜は舞い降りた","description":"2017 год по республиканскому календарю. Европа. 132-я дивизия армии Союза Европейских республик пошла на врага в надежде отбить Санкт-Петербург, однако британские военные узнали об этом и устроили засаду. В Нарве дивизию взяли в кольцо. Несмотря на численное превосходство противника, специальное подразделение «В-0» Японии, состоящее из парней и девушек так называемой Одиннадцатой зоны, начало операцию по спасению отрезанной дивизии. Шанс на успех операции был практически равен нулю. Среди «счастливчиков», входящих в состав «В-0», был и Акито Хюга — одиннадцатый и пилот найтмэра, ранее известного как Призрак Ганнибала. Именно он — скрытое оружие специального подразделения «Отряд Виверн», и далеко не так прост, как может показаться на первый взгляд. Что же ждёт «Отряд Виверн» во главе с Лейлой Малкал , так обеспокоенной проблемой одиннадцатых?","year":2012,"type":"TV","genres":["Фантастика","меха","военное"],"rating":7.32,"popularity":37365,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[15197],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/8888/01df14a4c1f48208e8de15387dd92776.jpeg","width":730,"height":1000},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8888-EZToEW9y1Z2C.jpg","width":1600,"height":600}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-6253","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/167154/39e2c05477b0cfdaf875d83e88f14f01/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-610","dubId":"610","label":"AniLibria.TV","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-17259","translationId":"610","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/450409/3af682f8c9a388c1b16cb